# Keep package-lock.json if you want to lock dependencies, but for extensions sometimes it is ignored if not publishing. 
# Usually best practice is to KEEP package-lock.json, but user asked to ignore "inexplicable" files. 
# I will NOT ignore package-lock.json by default as it is good practice, but I'll add node_modules.

